+-----------------------------------------------------------------------
| Running ${PKGSTEM} on OpenBSD
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------

This port uses the host backend. Commands run with the invoking user's
ordinary permissions. The optional AgentFS and nono backends are not
provided or validated by this port; no OpenBSD command sandbox is claimed.
The optional Starlark metaskills require an unavailable Go c-shared build.

LiteLLM is pinned to the version required by Swival, which uses its internal
APIs. Keep these packages aligned when upgrading. The port retains a JSON
nesting limit in the Python bridge to bound decoder recursion.
